cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you reference this software, please cite it as below.
title: "ca-tariff-parse: deterministic, fully cited parsing of published California electricity rate schedules"
abstract: >-
  A command line parser that turns published California electricity rate
  schedules into machine-readable structured data. Every emitted value carries
  provenance back to a specific document, page, sheet, section and line, and
  content the parser does not understand is reported rather than dropped. The
  output represents a document and is not a bill estimate or rate advice.
